Hang on here, what all this is leading to is the inclusion of a number of specialist shops in nethack, i.e. `You enter the healers surgery', or `... the magicians shop' where charges etc. are sold. I for one am not sure I want this sort of thing in nethack. The game to me has always been something that, although quite complex in many ways is based around a simple idea. I think if this is carried to far it will remove the style of game that is essentially nethack.
(All this IMHO)

